<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tennis-Fernandez reaches quarter-finals.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tennis-Fernandez reaches quarter-finals.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>American 14th seed Mary Joe Fernandez battled her way through to the quarter-finals of the Australian Open on Monday with a three-set victory over Patty Schnyder of Switzerland.</p>
<p>Fernandez, world ranked 17, recovered from a tentative start to beat 63rd ranked Schnyder 4-6 6-4 6-1 in a match lasting one hour and 58 minutes.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
